  "question": {
    "text": "<p>There are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></math> radioactive nuclei in a given radioactive element. Its half-life time is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi></math>. How many nuclei will remain after <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>?<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>414</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p>",
